# Goblin Welder: Bot1 sacrifices Welding Jar to put it in the graveyard, then on turn three taps the Welder to choose its Ornithopter and the Jar card in that same player's graveyard; they swap at once (CR 101.4), so the Jar is back and the Ornithopter gone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Goblin Welder
Welding Jar
Ornithopter
Mountain
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Goblin Welder.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Welding Jar.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Welding Jar.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Welder.Activate
Bot1.Target(Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Welding Jar)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Battlefield = Mountain; Goblin Welder; Welding Jar
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Welder.Tapped = true
